                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The health of our wastewater treatment plants is critical infrastructure that we cannot take for granted. I\u2019m glad to join my colleagues to help upgrade the Grantsville treatment plant and provide safe, clean water access to Marylanders in Garrett County.\nhttps://t.co/qJuDdEwXqc",
