                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I requested $3 million in federal funding to support the design and engineering of a critical expansion at GRMC\u2019s Radiology/Oncology Department.\n\nThis pre-construction work is the first step toward a radiation treatment facility that will bring life-saving cancer care closer to home \u2014 especially for underserved and rural residents who often travel hours for treatment.\n\nWith rural hospitals facing increasing financial strain, targeted investments like this are vital to protect access to quality care where it\u2019s needed most",
                "text_lang": "en",
