                "quoted_status_id": "1995447797080871020",
                "quoted_status_profile_id": "14159148",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "UN",
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, on #WorldAIDSDay, I\u2019m honoring the lives lost to HIV/AIDS and all who have been impacted, from my own friends living with a diagnosis to those around the world touched by this epidemic.\n\nAs a member of @sciencedems and a representative of key federal facilities in Maryland\u2019s 6th, I\u2019m a firm believer in strong, federally funded research to fight this crisis. Work seen through education, innovative treatments, and the search for a cure\u2014and for a future free from stigma and discrimination. Together, we can end HIV/AIDS once and for all.",
                "text_lang": "en",
