                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Enough is enough. The Administration must comply with Judge Xinis' ruling to immediately release Mr. \u00c1brego Garc\u00eda.  I await a response from Acting Director Lechleitner to my Congressional letter requesting an immediate tour of the ICE Baltimore facility, the treatment of those being detained and how ICE conducts its operations within the 6th District.\n\nhttps://t.co/42RL0DnlM9",
