                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank you @RepJimmyGomez and @DemocracyFwd for fighting\u2014and winning\u2014in court. Members of Congress must have immediate access to ICE facilities to inspect the conditions and treatment of the people from our districts who may be detained. This is our constitutional duty, and I\u2019ve formally demanded access to ICE\u2019s Baltimore facility. More: https://t.co/O5JXTRPPcN",
